Taobao Coins

This distribution adapts task navigation, browsing, and quiz logic from
czl0325/coin11-tb, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Upstream source: https://github.com/czl0325/coin11-tb
Upstream revision used by the local project: d4d738e

The adapted code has been reorganized and modified for a coin-only workflow,
whole-row task filtering, Taobao foreground checks, regional screenshot OCR,
completion detection, nonblocking quizzes, and portable launch scripts.

Modifications in this distribution are provided under Apache-2.0.
